{"id":"n2-183","title":"～恐れがある (〜osore ga aru)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Express a concern or fear that something undesirable might occur.","longExplanation":"The ～恐れがある grammar point indicates that there is a concern or fear that something undesirable or negative might happen. It is often used for potential problems or risks, and can be translated as 'there is a risk' or 'there is a possibility'.","formation":"Verb-dictionary form + 恐れがある","examples":[{"jp":"地震が来る恐れがあるため、避難所に行ってください。","romaji":"Jishin ga kuru osore ga aru tame, hinanjo ni itte kudasai.","en":"Please go to the evacuation center because there is a risk of an earthquake.","words":[{"surface":"地震","vocabId":"1421210","reading":"じしん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来る","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"くる"},{"surface":"恐れ","vocabId":"1236660","reading":"おそれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":"1296400","reading":"ある"},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"避難","vocabId":"1484660","reading":"ひなん"},{"surface":"所","vocabId":"1343100","reading":"ところ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行っ","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"彼は事故に遭う恐れがあるので、注意して運転してください。","romaji":"Kare wa jiko ni au osore ga aru node, chuui shite unten shite kudasai.","en":"There's a possibility he might have an accident, so please drive carefully.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"事故","vocabId":"1313850","reading":"じこ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遭う","vocabId":"1198180","reading":"あう"},{"surface":"恐れ","vocabId":"1236660","reading":"おそれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":"1296400","reading":"ある"},{"surface":"ので","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"注意","vocabId":"1426530","reading":"ちゅうい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"運転","vocabId":"1172830","reading":"うんてん"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"この薬を飲みすぎると、副作用の恐れがある。","romaji":"Kono kusuri wo nomisugiru to, fukusayou no osore ga aru.","en":"If you take too much of this medicine, there is a risk of side effects.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"薬","vocabId":"1538160","reading":"くすり"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"飲み","vocabId":"1169870","reading":"のむ","baseForm":"飲む"},{"surface":"すぎる","vocabId":"1195970","reading":"すぎる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"副作用","vocabId":"1500400","reading":"ふくさよう"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"恐れ","vocabId":"1236660","reading":"おそれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":"1296400","reading":"ある"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[9,10,11]},{"jp":"低い予算でこのプロジェクトを進めると、品質が低くなる恐れがある。","romaji":"Hikui yosan de kono purojekuto wo susumeru to, hinshitsu ga hikuku naru osore ga aru.","en":"If we proceed with this project on a low budget, the quality may suffer.","words":[{"surface":"低い","vocabId":"1434180","reading":"ひくい"},{"surface":"予算","vocabId":"1543000","reading":"よさん"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"プロジェクト","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"進める","vocabId":"1365990","reading":"すすめる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"品質","vocabId":"1490580","reading":"ひんしつ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"低く","vocabId":"1434180","reading":"ひくい","baseForm":"低い"},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","rea